["Ingabe usuzwile ngodaba loMqulekisi na?","NgaloloSuku ubuso [babantu] buyobe budangale.","Bukhandlekile bukhathele.","Bayongena eMlilweni ovuthayo.","Bayophuza emthonjeni ogxabhayo.","Abuyikuthola okunye ukudla, ngaphandle kwameva.","Akukhuluphalisi futhi akusuthisi.","Ubuso [babanye] ngaloloSuku buyobe buthakasile.","Bethokozile ngemisebenzi yawo.","BeseJana [esivandeni] ephakeme.","Abayikuzwa khona inkulumo eyize engasanga.","Kunemithombo egelezayo.","Kunemibhede ephakeme.","Nenkambi ezihleliwe.","Nemiqamelo ehlelekile.","Kanye namacanci kakhaphethi andlalwe ndawo yonke.","Ingabe abaliboni ikameli ukuba lidalwe kanjani na?","Nesibhakabhaka ukuba siphakanyiswe kanjani na?","Nezintaba ukuba zigxunyekwe kanjani na?","Nomhlaba ukuba undlalwe kanjani na?","Ngakhoke xwayisa, ngokuba ungumexwayisi nje kuphela.","Akuwona umsebenzi wakho ukubaphoqa.","Kepha lowo ofulathelayo [iqiniso] futhi engakholwa;","U Allah uyomujezisa ngesijeziso esinzima.","Nebala, bazobuyela [emuva kokufa] Kithi.","Futhi yithina esiyobahlulela."]